## Legend

| Shape | SES construct |
|---|---|
| `[Name]` rectangle | Root, coupled entity, atomic leaf, or specialization option |
| `(name)` rounded rectangle | Aspect (decomposition hub) |
| `([name])` stadium | Multi-aspect (replicated group) |
| `{name}` diamond | Specialization choice-point |

Edge labels carry:

- `more than one` — from a multi-aspect to its unit entity.
- specialization option name — from a specialization diamond to each option.
- message name (`Msg` or `Msg as RecvMsg`) — in the couplings graph.

Unlabeled edges are structural (parent → aspect, aspect → child entity).
